# Snort LuCI — generated config

Do **not** restore **Use snort.lua only** / `#snort-manual`. LuCI always saves `manual: false` so Listen on, Home network, mode, and **How packets are captured** apply.

`snort.uc` already `include()`s `/etc/snort/snort.lua`. `snort.init` default is `'manual:bool:0'`.

| `method` | Meaning |
|----------|---------|
| `afpacket` | Usual IDS on the interface |
| `nfq` | Prevention only (hide unless IPS) |
| `pcap` | Remap to `afpacket` |

Jail: `chown snort:snort` + rw-mount `temp_dir` and `log_dir`. Remap `/var/log` → `/var/log/snort`.

Footer Save & Apply only. No Blocky/Suricata header cross-links. No CM5 / 2.5 GbE copy in views.
